{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13401","headline":"登秦望山 · 薛据","name":"登秦望山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南登秦望山，目极大海空。\n朝阳半荡漾，晃朗天水红。\n谿壑争喷薄，江湖遰交通。\n而多渔商客，不悟岁月穷。\n振缗迎早潮，弭櫂候长风。\n予本萍泛者，乘流任西东。\n茫茫天际帆，栖泊何时同。\n将寻会稽迹，从此访任公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛据","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13401.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13401","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}